        Root cause:
        The original implementation of `phy_start_aneg` did not properly manage the PHY lock, which could lead to race conditions or inconsistent states when multiple threads attempted to start auto-negotiation simultaneously. This could cause issues when other functions, like `phy_ethtook_ksettings_set`, also require the PHY lock, leading to potential deadlocks or data corruption.

